{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eec3844758cb5e47a667ef45d0baa23f66a37f4703051ea151bcd8cf48edf782", "ja": "（今日は、劇場の定期公演。この公演が終わったら、\n次は育の新曲お披露目公演だ。ええと、育は……）", "zh": "（今天是剧场的定期公演。公演结束后，接下来就是育的新曲发表公演了。呃，育她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8b41f9ad93901d268ce9f6f199514e5f54374e499f9bf017ec60762ee6cfcb06", "ja": "育、環、ここにいたんだな……\n朋花も一緒だったのか。みんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "育、环，原来你们在这里啊……朋花也和你们一起吗？大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "4ed7e47e902c3238cfc85a0d2bb6dd8bd1055cd23ad400f3b3ae40d453142885", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nおつかれさま！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "3b281d5ed95ef097166c98a622bbd6dc574852ba884ceac2173a6f4b51671038", "ja": "今日は、ともかたちの公演があるから、\nたまきと育も見学に来たんだ～。", "zh": "今天有朋花她们的公演，所以环和育也来参观啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f36a52521c3503d1eb2fca78a8ac3a83de04bd3b26d7d3fa8653e5242197d23a", "ja": "そうか、今日は見学の日だったな。\n朋花、よろしくな。", "zh": "这样啊，今天是来参观的日子啊。\n朋花，就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "78c4061e5295bb05f502339f69112611678eb399701906477dbefc65e87ab6e2", "ja": "はい～。子豚ちゃんたちはもちろんですが、育ちゃんや\n環ちゃんに見てもらえるのも、うれしいですね～。", "zh": "好的～。小猪崽们就不用说了，\n能让小育和小环来看，我也很高兴呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "74bb183e16af7db9071cc5d3600a0fe943f38ec451e2fdbf7649e077d5c0a29e", "ja": "そうだな。特に育は、次の公演のためにも\nしっかり見ておいた方がいいかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "是啊。尤其是育，为了下一场公演，最好还是好好看看比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "4121edcb647fdc15bf32e9e26459e733d9f15bd4851c6d1533e9cec31e3e9e24", "ja": "わたし？\nどういうこと？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "我吗？\n这是什么意思啊？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8db186542ee6712934bcf3aa847e06eeefc4d532a79814f2a11347ecac3ce681", "ja": "ああ。次の公演では、育の新しい曲を\nお披露目しようと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "啊。下一场公演，我想让大家听听育的新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "0c9a62d21b94aebf1b12a903d5c1200e0cf78a6c0eb581d849928b2b988be0bb", "ja": "えっ、わたしの新しい曲！？\n{$P$}さん、それ本当！？", "zh": "咦，我的新歌！？\n{$P$}先生，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1010_p", "source_sha256": "afbf796bc7eeb4b788d26976fc5ba881bf813b126a93c98f0f29ddaab19ddacf", "ja": "本当だよ。今、曲を作ってもらっているところだ。\n頑張ろうな！", "zh": "真的哦。现在正在请人作曲。\n一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "5fe8e01671fc26b01677a7cfe331afd2f05761eed3deb6260f1d17958ad58247", "ja": "うんっ、わかった！\nわたし、今日は一生けんめい見学するね！", "zh": "嗯，知道啦！\n我今天会认真参观学习的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "d6eab5ec5f04887d2af02bc2b5cda325366a477904081402774d0a35613455f1", "ja": "新しい曲か～、いいな～！\nおやぶん、たまきも新しい曲ほしい！", "zh": "新歌啊～真好啊～！\n老大，环也想要新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e68350134a178069fc98a2fd8c5915a6f10d84cc15424633d3604a4dd6b1219d", "ja": "もちろん、環や朋花の曲も作ってるよ。\n順番だから、ふたりとも待っててくれ！", "zh": "当然也在为环和朋花创作歌曲哦。\n要按顺序来，所以你们两个先等一等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "c1702435b6b2e68be3b8749868028819bf9dbd2b559a6d75b9b4c4fc8df70f05", "ja": "は～い！　くふふ、楽しみだぞ……♪", "zh": "好～！咕嘻嘻，好期待啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1015_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "3515289e0ebf0b39b33f237144fc2b96a8a115971446216f907a6db51d1ef56a", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ここにいたんですね！\nた、大変なんです～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，原来您在这里啊！\n不、不好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5d6fe159caf63dafa9b686bf80763c57f7e25cc1b36008e8afc0eb39ff3cccbb", "ja": "青羽さん、そんなに慌ててどうかしたんですか？\n何かトラブルでも？", "zh": "青羽小姐，怎么这么慌张，发生什么事了？\n是出了什么麻烦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "3f0bfb1e783852d338ceea7739df36c7c0affa0f719c0f5bd8ea3a1e9d35735b", "ja": "それが、公演の衣装をチェックしていたら、\n朋花ちゃんの衣装のボタンがなくなってたんです！", "zh": "是这样，我检查演出的服装时，发现朋花的服装上少了一颗纽扣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "c9b77e7b0028d939fbc2dfb931ef29d5ee20fa30fee6f8b6dd8dc2be63af220b", "ja": "胸元の、目立つ場所で……だから予備のボタンを\nつけようとしたんですけど、手元に在庫がなくて……。", "zh": "是在胸口很显眼的位置……所以我想钉上备用纽扣，可是手头没有库存……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "1e363b134cf30b7b486f0558751be4ffdec9edf9d3a3ed1bced60440644aa904", "ja": "ううっ……{$P$}さん、\nどうしましょう……？", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}先生，\n这可怎么办呀……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ea50a36d36edd98bffb73e59cc3cc50d6b75dd1c47234b3e4b7aa97846d31cdb", "ja": "事情はわかりました。\nそういうことなら、急いで買ってきます！", "zh": "事情我明白了。\n既然是这样，我马上去买回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1022_102mis", "source_sha256": "f85c3a64dc7a41b1830abc46f67bc52b71911ea3e8f9391b131b01f9bab49bfa", "ja": "それが、すこし変わったデザインのボタンなので……\n街の大きな手芸用品店じゃないと、置いてないんです。", "zh": "那是一种设计有些特别的纽扣……\n只有城里那家大型手工艺用品店才有卖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1023_p", "source_sha256": "992c16c9a3ca7df11cd664b0366d9abd3f37f668e3fdc6d191cfdd5b8ab69475", "ja": "大きな手芸用品店……確か、隣の駅にありましたよね。\nわかりました、それじゃ……！", "zh": "大型手工用品店……我记得隔壁车站好像就有一家。\n我知道了，那我这就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "961039b45101c5283e93d9f428f53dec7ce49adbd7ca03784bd1a870659a82bc", "ja": "ちょっと待って、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "等等，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0a65be2520a04c1aac33f852f13f7898307c9a042979fe7d763b7baf6f784f4b", "ja": "どうしたんだ、育？　用事なら後に……。", "zh": "怎么了，育？有事的话就等会儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "eb4ed9d408a283d063914a5660c23391cb2b0d099fb184099d5c259908b429fc", "ja": "お買い物なら、わたしが行く！\nううん、わたしに行かせて！", "zh": "要是去买东西，我来！\n不，让我去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "6c2e49d24218cbb7e6d8c5a3f5cb82c9261ac72268f380b330e8431077af8edb", "ja": "だって、{$P$}さんは\n今日の公演の準備で、いそがしいでしょ？", "zh": "因为，{$P$}先生要忙着准备今天的公演，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "1cbd38e67e2af3fa2a629f742b6d01086e6abc49181375ea9d165c7dfb86413e", "ja": "たまきも一緒に行くぞ、おやぶん！", "zh": "环也要一起去，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a33935fb6d70801fad0148ffb7c55c27e8f6bbcfd324928590690e9d2ffce7a8", "ja": "育……環……。それは助かるけど、\n本当にふたりで大丈夫か？", "zh": "育……环……那确实帮大忙了，不过，真的两个人没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "94b58d6b5febb3071f2d57ab0e3d4ff130b152836adc525da903714000e6da8c", "ja": "{$P$}さん？\nわたしのこと、何さいだと思ってるの？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？\n你以为我已经几岁了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "54566fab3402489da508914e717b217fe02757db99923127da6b3d8cf4d734c4", "ja": "ボタンのお店なら、おかあさんと行ったことあるよ。\nそれに環ちゃんもいるから、心配しなくて大丈夫！", "zh": "卖纽扣的店，我以前和妈妈一起去过哦。\n而且还有环在，所以不用担心，放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "0445a7c18d69c5e5dd3d64083c26d8b9b624a8a353915149521512b1a4a20f7b", "ja": "そうだよ！\nだから、たまきと育にまかせて、おやぶん！", "zh": "没错！\n所以就交给环和育吧，大哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1033_p", "source_sha256": "94f4bbb819b7e877086d5684ca222cfde6950be89a21ef3be32653be6a238cae", "ja": "（小学生のふたりに頼むのは、少し心配だけど……\nこれも、成長には必要な事かもしれないな）", "zh": "（把事情交给两个小学生，确实让人有点担心……\n但这或许也是成长所必需的吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1034_p", "source_sha256": "c9242ab9ca2a356cd5e004698d22ec63f461956a50e3d8e085f2e743c01b90da", "ja": "わかった。じゃあ、ふたりに買い物をお願いするよ。\nその代わり、困った事が起きたらすぐ連絡するように！", "zh": "明白了。那就拜托你们两个人去买东西吧。\n作为交换，要是遇到了麻烦，一定要马上联系我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1036_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1037_p", "source_sha256": "45d4cc6ffeee9eeccd414711c506cdafe990a6d6c406a5621ba0fcc81a5df245", "ja": "あと、知らない人には絶対についていっちゃダメだ。\n青信号でも、車が来ないのを確認してから渡るんだぞ！", "zh": "还有，绝对不能跟着陌生人走。\n就算是绿灯，也要确认没有车开过来之后再过马路哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1038_030iku", "source_sha256": "cb9aa8586a66341ccdcfd1810d80eec8bc2d563a5f37ce58e4aca1613b8aa75d", "ja": "もう！　{$P$}さんは心配しすぎ！\n小さい子じゃないんだから、それくらいわかってるよ？", "zh": "真是的！{$P$}先生太爱操心了！\n我又不是小孩子，这种事情还是懂的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1039_102mis", "source_sha256": "e1fe4fd90103d905991fa8c5bebe676313403080aed6e8a7883d02defd591977", "ja": "育ちゃん、環ちゃん、ありがとう。スマホに地図と\nボタンの画像を送るから、同じ物を買ってきてね。", "zh": "育、环，谢谢你们。我会把地图和按钮的照片发到手机上，你们照着买同样的东西回来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1040_030iku", "source_sha256": "a6a9d919046b88dd53dc00aac254f0a5c3a53969281967e6e022a8e7ee967779", "ja": "わかったよ、美咲さん！", "zh": "知道了，美咲小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1041_031tom", "source_sha256": "1a4b0ea9e4bb5a1d5cf228f80bc703a9c6f039eebcab267e1c8f371a5ad89133", "ja": "ふたりとも、車に気をつけてくださいね～。\n戻ってきたら、ご褒美をあげましょう～。", "zh": "你们两个都要小心车辆哦～  \n回来之后，我会给你们奖励哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1042_040tam", "source_sha256": "5d692e2ce04ed6ff1cf10ca9413387e47ff8aafb53cb9ab2e4ca0ca7781ce0d8", "ja": "ともか、ほんと？\nごほうび楽しみだな～、くふふっ♪", "zh": "朋花，真的吗？\n好期待奖励啊～，咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1043_030iku", "source_sha256": "e0d9b8cbd4d5426e83009f362cd7e1568bc1896da11fd8307982b818faa49cb7", "ja": "それじゃあ、{$P$}さん、\n美咲さん、朋花さん、いってきまーす！", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生，美咲姐姐、朋花姐姐，我出发啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1044_p", "source_sha256": "e8d0fdc3cf1e907b2bba430cf6a1236c6b6b11bd263c1354d9347381d8f341b4", "ja": "ふたりとも、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "两位，就拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_064_1045_p", "source_sha256": "958f3de2894c0f1cf91113e714912e42c896eceff51c0d329a764598a74934cd", "ja": "（育と環のおつかい……不安はあるが、\nふたりを信じて、今日の公演の準備を進めよう！）", "zh": "（育和环去办事……虽然有些不安，但还是相信她们，继续准备今天的公演吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
